    <briefdescription>
<para>A <ref refid="namespacellvm_1a8e612822d4ba7bb36c9c79582a567108" kindref="member">BumpPtrAllocator</ref> that allows only elements of a specific type to be allocated. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This allows calling the destructor in <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_specific_bump_ptr_allocator_1a9f4abb0f59d9fd2ce9dfe8ceebffcb38" kindref="member">DestroyAll()</ref> and when the allocator is destroyed. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
